   <photoshop:TextLayers>
    <rdf:Bag>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="We had an amazing day at the Funplex! It is always so wonderful"
      photoshop:LayerText="We had an amazing day at the Funplex! It is always so wonderful for us to be able to make it up from Florida to see so many of our campers and families. It warms our hearts to see the excitement and hugs and hear of the get togethers that have happened since camp. It reminds us of a summer trip day spent with bunkmates and camp friends playing arcade games, riding rides, racing around the go-kart track, challenging each other in laser tag, winning tons of tickets and prizes, and by seeing all the laughs and smiles amongst each other. We enjoyed our pizza lunch and ice cream sandwiches while watching the camp slideshow and then taking an incredible group photo! We hope you all loved getting the Lindenmere Pom Hats and Summer 2017 CD as holiday gifts! The reunion truly helps the long off season feel shorter and continues to build on one of the most rewarding communities to be a part of, CAMP. We hope everyone who came had a great time, and for those of you who couldnâ€™t join us, you were missed!  We look forward to our spring picnic and the first day of camp when we are reunited for summer 2018. Itâ€™s just around the corner!"/>
    </rdf:Bag>
   </photoshop:TextLayers>
